WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:02.769
[music playing]

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:24.891
- There's a bunch of packages
in here from the Netherlands.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.327
So we're looking for narcotics.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:38.905
Anywhere in Europe are pretty
good packages to check.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.407
So here we have Great Britain.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:52.051
This one looks good.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.854
This is a package from the UK.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.790
It's candy.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.425
These are good.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.368
OK, you've got a package
coming from the Netherlands,

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.370
says it has documents in it.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:21.314
That looks like a CD case,
but inside, there's no CD.

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:28.054
It doesn't look right.

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:30.123
So we're going to take
a look at that one.

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.408
I don't see any
documents in here.

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.176
You're buying a video
game, it's not just

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.212
going to be blank like this.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.947
And this is puffy.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.815
There's red flags all over this.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.955
Something interesting.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:05.758
There's a rocky substance.

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:14.300
We see a lot of MDMA
from the Netherlands.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:17.804
The person has put
cards inside, thanking

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.907
them for being a good customer.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.575
They're not going
to get this order.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:32.185
Now we're going to test
what we thought was MDMA.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.659
I just need a little sample.

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:40.660
We don't need much.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.741
Positive for MDMA ecstasy.

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.247
But this is a Schedule I,
so it's going to be seized.

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.816
And it'll be destroyed.

